     Speaking for nethack rather than Spork:  in addition to
wearing the Eyes, which cause blindness to end as soon as it
starts, there are several ways.  (1) Already be blind or be
in an eyeless form--probably not too useful for avoiding
blindness; (2) wear a blindfold--not as silly as #1, assuming
that it isn't cursed; (3) wield Sunsword; (4) polymorph into
a yellow light or an Archon; or (5) exploit a 3.4.3 bug
(which is already known and has been fixed) by carrying a
potion of blindness in your weapon, alternate weapon, or
quiver inventory slot.  [Now how many players are going to
start exploiting that?  Will any of them at least wait until
seeing the approach of a yellow light?]

     Those things protect against being blinded by light-based
effects including lightning, but not against other forms such
as drinking a potion of blindness.



